    <mj-section padding="0px">
      <mj-column padding="0px">
        <mj-spacer height="20px"></mj-spacer>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section
  background-color="#eff1f4"
  padding="1px 1px 1px 1px"
  border-radius="10px"
>
  <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="10px" padding="0px">
    <mj-image
      border-radius="10px 10px 0 0"
      padding="0"
      width="600px"
      src="https://www.londonsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
      alt="REPLACE_ME"
      href="https://www.londonsummary.com/"
    />
    <mj-text
      padding="20px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <h2
        style="
          font-size: 24px;
          line-height: 1.2;
          font-weight: 400;
          margin: 0;
        "
      >
        Pixar comes alive
      </h2>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text
      padding="0px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Arial"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 0px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  An immersive Pixar exhibition, “Mundo Pixar,” has opened in London’s Wembley Park, marking its first UK appearance after touring Europe. The experience features 14 life-size, interactive sets inspired by iconic Pixar films like Toy Story, Up, Coco, Cars, and Finding Nemo.
</p>
<p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 0px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  Spanning 3,500 square metres, the exhibition offers a one-way walkthrough with detailed environments, soundscapes, and photo opportunities. A London-exclusive room recreates Sunnyside Daycare from Toy Story. The exhibition blends storytelling, design, and interactivity to bring Pixar’s worlds to life.
</p>
      <p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  🔗 <strong>Link:</strong>
<a
  style="
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #80011f;
    color: black;
  "
  href="https://www.disneytickets.co.uk/mundo-pixar-experience-tickets"
  target="_blank"
>Mundo Pixar</a><br />📅 <strong>When:</strong> February 13 to June 28<br />💸 <strong>Cost:</strong> Starts from £29<br />📍 <strong>Where:</strong>
<a
  style="
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #80011f;
    color: black;
  "
  href="https://www.disneytickets.co.uk/mundo-pixar-experience-tickets"
  target="_blank"
>Fulton Road, Wembley</a>
</p>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

    <mj-section padding="0px">
      <mj-column padding="0px">
        <mj-spacer height="20px"></mj-spacer>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding="0px">
