      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section
  background-color="#eff1f4"
  padding="1px 1px 1px 1px"
  border-radius="10px"
>
  <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="10px" padding="0px">
    <mj-image
      border-radius="10px 10px 0 0"
      padding="0"
      width="600px"
      src="https://www.londonsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
      alt="REPLACE_ME"
      href="https://www.londonsummary.com/"
    />
    <mj-text
      padding="20px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <h2
        style="
          font-size: 24px;
          line-height: 1.2;
          font-weight: 400;
          margin: 0;
        "
      >
        Stop motion magic
      </h2>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text
      padding="0px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Arial"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 0px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  London’s Young V&amp;A is hosting Inside Aardman: Wallace &amp; Gromit and Friends, celebrating 50 years of Aardman Animations. The exhibition offers a behind-the-scenes look at beloved creations like Wallace &amp; Gromit, Shaun the Sheep, Morph, and Chicken Run.
</p>
<p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 0px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  Featuring over 150 archival items, including original sketches, storyboards, and film props, it traces the full stop-motion production pipeline. Designed as an interactive experience, visitors can experiment with animation techniques, lighting, and character design
</p>
      <p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  🔗 <strong>Link:</strong>
<a
  style="
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #80011f;
    color: black;
  "
  href="https://www.vam.ac.uk/exhibitions/inside-aardman-wallace-gromit-and-friends"
  target="_blank"
>Inside Aardman: Wallace &amp; Gromit and Friends</a><br />📅 <strong>When:</strong> February 12 to November 15<br />💸 <strong>Cost:</strong> Starts from £12.50<br />📍 <strong>Where:</strong>
<a
  style="
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #80011f;
    color: black;
  "
  href="https://www.vam.ac.uk/exhibitions/inside-aardman-wallace-gromit-and-friends"
  target="_blank"
>Young V&amp;A</a>
</p>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

