          "
        >
          <strong>The Vault - Restricted Access</strong>
        </p>
        <p style="line-height: 24px">The Vault is an exclusive, no-cameras soca night blending luxury, mystery, and high-energy vibes, accessible only via ticket code, promising surprises and a premium bacchanal experience for true insiders.</p>
